<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">GALATIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatifoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">GALATIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">GALATIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul hworɔle sɔ krataa he wɔ ye nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ nanu, anaa sɔ akwanduo ne si. Na ɔhworɔle ye kɔyɛ afoɛ 50-52 Y.A<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> wɔ Korinto anaa Antiokia bɔ ɔwɔ Siria ne. Ɔhworɔ mane asafo ahoroɛ bɔ ne ɔwɔ Galatia ne, yeti ne asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Pisidia, Antiokia, Ikoniom, Listra ne Derbi ne kɔkenga krataa he bie. Bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ sɔ asafo nemɔ nu ne, né ebiemɔ te Yudafoɛ, na ne ebiemɔ koso te maen-maen nufoɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Né ebiemɔ keka kyɛ, odikyɛ Kristofoɛ di Mose mmeraa naso, na bɛyɛ Yuda som nu amanne ahoroɛ te kyɛ toa pɛlɛ. Yeti, Paul fale krataa ne bɔle sɔ dwirɛ nemɔ guale.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul sa maa bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, sɛ ebie kɔyɛ teneneeniɛ a, ogyi gyidie bɔ ole ye wɔ Yesu Kristo nu naso, na ɔtte Mose mmeraa ne bɔ okoli so ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul nwo dwirɛ biemɔ wɔ Galatifoɛ krataa nanu, bɔ wanga ye wɔ ye ngrataa ahoroɛ nemɔ nu ɔ. Ná ɔmaa bɛnwuni kyɛ, ye bɔbɔ yeɛ ɔhworɔle sɔ krataa ne ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa ne edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-9">1:1-9</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul hane somafoɛ bɔ ɔte nanwo dwirɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:10-2:14">1:10–2:14</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo nu gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa ebie yɛ teneneeniɛ ɔ, ɔtte Mose mmeraa ne bɔ ebie koli so ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:15-4:20">2:15–4:20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul hyirele Kristofoɛ ahofadie nanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 4:21-6:10">4:21–6:10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Me Paul yeɛ metworɔ krataa he ɔ. Nde somafoɛ, nakoso nná sona yeɛ ɔyele me kyɛ mmanyɛ somafoɛ ɔ, na ɔnnate sona biala so koso, mmom Yesu Kristo ne Baba Nyameɛ bɔ otingyele ye fili ewue nu ne yeɛ bɛyele me ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Mene aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ me nwo wa namukoraati, yɛfa krataa he yɛkɔma asafo ahoroɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Galatia ne:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Ye yeɛ ɔfale ye ngoa tole berɛ mane yɛ bɔne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, okole yɛ kofi wiase bɔne bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ kesaalae nanu, kyɛbɔ yɛ Nyameɛ ne yɛ Baba ne pɛ te ne, <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />ye yeɛ anuonyam ha ye daa, daa. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ɔyɛ me nwanwa kyɛ ɛmɔtwe ɛmɔ nwo ndɛ bɛfi Bɔ ɔnate Kristo adom so frɛle ɛmɔ nanwo, ná ɛmɔkɔ nzɛmba foforɛ nwo ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Ɛhene po de, ɔtte nzɛmba. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiemɔ ha ɛmɔ, na bɛpena kyɛ bɛsesã Kristo nzɛmba ne. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Nakoso, sɛ yɛ, anaa abɔfo po fi anwuro baka nzɛmba foforɛ, bɔ ɔne bɔ yɛha yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ne nyia a, ye yaakɔ!<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnome ha ye.”</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kyɛbɔ yali moa yaha ne, mesa meka ye bieku, nzɛmba he si ne, sɛ ebie baka nzɛmba foforɛ biala kyire ɛmɔ a, ye yaakɔ!<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnome ha ye.” </char></note><verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Aso, sona yeɛ mepena kyɛ odɛ́ me to nu, anaa Nyameɛ? Anaa sona yeɛ mepena kyɛ mesɔ ye nye ɔ? Sɛ sona yeɛ mepena kyɛ mesɔ ye nye de a, ahaa mengɔyɛ Kristo akoaa. <verse eid="GAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Aliemaa mɔ, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, nzɛmba bɔ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ ne, ɔtte sona deɛ, <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />na nná sona yeɛ ɔfa mane me ɔ, yeɛ bangyire me koso. Mmom Yesu Kristo bɔbɔ yeɛ ɔyele ye ali hyirele me ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Medɛ́ medi kyɛ ɛmɔ ate bra bɔ mmɔle, mmerɛ bɔ ne nwɔ Yuda som nu ne, kyɛbɔ nduli me nye nziele Nyameɛ asafo naso, bɔ ne mepena kyɛ megu ye ne. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Né mahɔ me nyunu wɔ Yuda som nu matra bɛ bɔ mene bɛ sili so wɔ me maen nanu namu, ofikyɛ né me baba mɔ amammerɛ nwo hia me paa.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Né me bɔ me baba mɔ amammerɛ nwo mmɔden paa.”</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔyele me fili me maame kunu, na ɔnate ye adom so frɛle me ne nwuni kyɛ, ɔte pa kyɛ <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />ɔfa me so da ɔwa né ali, ná wamaa maha ye nwo dwirɛ mahyire maen-maen ne, mambere me nwo manzusu ye nwo mangyire dasaniɛ biala, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />na sɔ ala yeɛ manngɔ bɛ bɔ bɛli moa bɛyɛle asomafoɛ kora yeɛ mebaayɛ bie ne berɛ wɔ Yerusalem, mmom ngɔle Arabia, yesi ne, nza ngɔle Damasko.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Afoɛ nza si kora yeɛ mekɔ Yerusalem mekɔsra Kefa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ ole </char><char style="bd">Petro</char>. </note> ɔ, na nnili ye berɛ ngyẽa buru-ne-nnu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Asomafoɛ ngaa ne de, mannwu bɛ, sana Awurade aliema Yakobo ngome. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Na edwirɛ bɔ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ne, Nyameɛ nyunu ɛhe, membɛ anoanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ye si ne, ngɔle Siria ne Kilikia mandanu dɔ, <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />nakoso Kristo asafo bɔ ne ɔwɔ Yudea nemɔ de, né bɛnwuni me nyunu lle. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Edwirɛ bɔ ne bate ala yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Biaa bie bɔ daa ne, né ɔtane yɛ nye ne, afei de, ɔbɔ gyidie bɔ ahaa ɔpena kyɛ ɔsɛkye ye nanwo dawure.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ná me ti, bɛhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam paa.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Afei, afoɛ buru-ne-nná si ne, mene Barnaba sa hɔle Yerusalem, né Tito boka yɛ so. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nyameɛ yele nikye bie hyirele me, yeti yeɛ ɔmaa ngɔle dɔ ne. Ná mmaa bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, meka nzɛmba ne mekyire maen-maen ne. Nakoso, nga ngyirele mbanyi bɔ bɛbu bɛ ne ngome, ofikyɛ né mesuro kyɛ annea a, né mirika bɔ matu, anaa bɔ metu ne ayɛ mbaen. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Né Tito boka me so, ná ye bɔ ɔte Greekniɛ ne po, bannhyɛ ye kyɛ ɔpɛ ye toa. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Bɔ waafa edwirɛ namukoraati wawa yeɛ ole kyɛ, aliemaa ngondombofoɛ biemɔ ayɛ kodɛɛ baawura asafo nanu, bafeɛfea bɛ nwo baawura yɛ nu, kyɛ bɛ baasɛkye ahofadie bɔ yɛle ye wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔfa yɛ bɛkɔyɛ ngoaa koraa. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Na yɛ de, yamma bɛ atee kaala po, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔtena nzɛmba nanwo nahorɛ nanu ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛbu bɛ nwo ne de, kyɛbɔ né bɛte biala ne, ɔmva me nwo, ofikyɛ nná kyɛbɔ ebie te ne yeɛ Nyameɛ nea ɔ; ná sɔ mmenia nemɔ koso, bannyɛ hwee bammoka me. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Mmom, bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, bafa bawura me sa kyɛ nga nzɛmba ne ngyire bɛ bɔ bɛpɛlle bɛ toa ne, kyɛbɔ Petro ka kyire bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Ofikyɛ bɔ ɔmane Petro tumi kyɛ ɔyɛ somafoɛ ma bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne, ye ala yeɛ ɔmane me tumi kyɛ nyɛ somafoɛ mma maen-maen. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ná mmerɛ bɔ Yakobo, Kefa ne Yohane, bɔ bayɛ kyɛ pila ne nwuni adom bɔ bafa balo me ne, bɛhyeale mene Barnaba sanu bɛfa bɛhyirele kyɛ, balɛ́ bato nu kyɛ yɛhɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne berɛ, na bɛ koso, bɛkɔhɔ bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne berɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Bɔ bɛha behyirele yɛ ala yeɛ ole kyɛ, “yɛkaye bɛ bɔ wahia bɛ ne,” ná ɛhene ala yeɛ ne mepena kyɛ meyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ Kefa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ ole Petro </char></note> wale Antiokia ne, nga ngyirele ye pen kyɛ bɔ ɔyɛ ne ttemaye. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, kora bɔ mmenia biemɔ fi Yakobo dɔ ba ne, né ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ maen-maen nanu ne didi. Nakoso, sɔ mmenia nemɔ wale ne, ɔyakyile, na ɔhwene ye nwo fili bɛ nwo, ofikyɛ né osuro bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Yudafoɛ bɔ baha ne koso yɛle sɔ nhwehwɛ-anim ne bie, maa Barnaba po ɔɔbokale bɛ so. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Na mmerɛ bɔ nwuni kyɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ne, ɔne nzɛmba nanwo nahorɛ ne nyia ne, nga ngyirele Kefa wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu kyɛ: “Sɛ wɔ, bɔ ɛte Yudaniɛ ne yɛ wɔ nikye te kyɛ maen-maen nuniɛ, ná ɔtte kyɛ Yudaniɛ a, ɛkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ahora aha ahyire maen-maen nanufoɛ kyɛ, bɛbɔ bɛ bra te kyɛ Yudafoɛ?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Yɛ de, bɛwole yɛ Yudafoɛ, na yɛtte kyɛ maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ bayɛ bɔne ne, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />yɛse kyɛ, nná mmeraa bɔ ebie koli so ne yeɛ ɔmaa bɛbu ye bem, mmom gyidie bɔ okonya ye wɔ Yesu Kristo nu ne. Yeti, yɛ koso, yanya Kristo nu gyidie, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛnate Kristo nu gyidie so bɛkobu yɛ bem, na ɔtte mmeraa bɔ yɛkoli so<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Mmeraa nyumaa.</char></note> ne. Ofikyɛ, sɛ ɔhale mmeraa<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Mmeraa nyumaa.</char></note> ne ngome a, ahaa ebiala nne berɛ bɔ bɛkobu ye bem ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ná mmerɛ bɔ yɛbɔ mmɔden kyɛ bɛkobu yɛ bem wɔ Kristo nu ne, sɛ bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ yɛte abɔnefoɛ a, ɛhene kyire kyɛ Kristo te ebie bɔ ɔfoa bɔne so anaa? Nyameɛ pa gua! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Yeti, sɛ mesa mesi bɔ mmerɛ bie ndwiri nguale ne a, ye de mato mmeraa. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Na me de, mmeraa bɔ nnili so nati, mawu wɔ mmeraa nanu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ngɔtena ase wɔ Nyameɛ nu. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Babɔ mene Kristo mukoraati asɛnnua nu, kesaalae nná me yeɛ nde ase ne, mmom Kristo yeɛ ɔte me nu ne. Ase bɔ nde ye anwoɔnaen nu ne, nde ye wɔ Nyameɛ awa nanu gyidie nu, ye yeɛ ɔlɔle me, na ɔfale ye nwo mane me ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Nyameɛ adom de, mengɔ po, ofikyɛ sɛ tenenee nate mmeraa so a, ye de ahaa mvasoɛ biala nne Kristo wue naso.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Galatifoɛ, ɛmɔ adwene nne berɛ hɔ? Nná ɛmɔ yeɛ bɛmaa ɛmɔ nwuni ye pefee kyɛ babɔ Yesu Kristo asɛnnua nu ne? Ye de, nwa yeɛ ɔlaka-lakale ɛmɔ sɔ ne? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Edwirɛ komapɛ yeɛ mepena kyɛ mebisa ɛmɔ ɔ: Aso, mmeraa bɔ ɛmɔ lili so ne yeɛ ɔmaa ɛmɔ nyane honhom ne, anaa edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔle bɛlili ne? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Sãa ɛmɔ ndwene sɔ? Honhom yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛhyɛle yebo ɔ, ye de nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔfa anwoɔnaen bɛyie ne? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Amaneɛ nwora bɔ ɛmɔ nwuni ye ne, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ mbaen? Ɛhe de, ɔngɔyɛ mbaen. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Aso mmeraa ne bɔ ɛmɔ lili so ne, yeɛ ɔmaa Nyameɛ fale ye honhom guale ɛmɔ so, ná ɔyɛle anwanwadeɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne? Anaa nzɛmba bɔ ɛmɔ tele, na ɛmɔle bɛlili ne?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Sɔ ala yeɛ Abraham “nyane gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu, na bɛbule ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Ɛmɔse ye paa kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛle gyidie ne yeɛ bɛte Abraham mmaa ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ná tworɔnzɛm ne ha tole berɛ kyɛ, gyidie yeɛ Nyameɛ nate so kobu maen-maen né bem ɔ, yeti Nyameɛ limoa hane nzɛmba ne hyirele Abraham kyɛ: “Wɔ ti, maen-maen namukoraati konya nhyira.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Né Abraham le gyidie, yeti ebiala bɔ ole gyidie ne, ɔne Abraham bɔ ne ole gyidie namukoraati anya nhyira.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ebiala bɔ ɔfa ye nwo to mmeraa<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Mmeraa nyumaa.</char></note> naso ne, owura nnome bo, ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ ɔmva bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ mmeraa nwomaa nanu namukoraati nnyɛ adwuma, ná onni so ne, nnome ha ye.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Afei enu la berɛ pefee kyɛ, sɛ ɔhale mmeraa ne ngome a, ahaa bɛngonya ebie bɔ ɔtengyɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu, ofikyɛ, “gyidie yeɛ ɔkɔmaa teneneeniɛ konya ngoa ɔ.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ɔwɔ nu, mmeraa ne, oggyi gyidie so, nakoso “ebiala bɔ odi so ne, ɔnate so konya ngoa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kristo tɔle yɛ, na olɛle yɛ fili mmeraa ne nnome nabo, na wasi yɛ gya nu wayɛ ebie bɔ badome ye, ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ: “Badome ebiala bɔ basinze ye wɔ bakaa so ne.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Olɛle yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Abraham nhyira ne kɔfa Kristo Yesu so kɔwa maen-maen naso, na yɛnate yɛ gyidie so anya honhom bɔ bafa bahyɛ yɛ bɔ ne.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔma mva asetena nu dwirɛ nyɛ mvandoho: Sɛ sona po yɛ apam, na bedɛ bɛto nu a, bɛngora bɛmbɛ nu, anaa bɛnzesa ye. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Abraham ne ye bosoniɛ ne yeɛ bɛhyɛle bɛ bɔ ɔ. Tworɔnzɛm ne anga kyɛ “ye bosofoɛ,” bɔ okyire mmeni pee, mmom ɔhane kyɛ “ye bosoniɛ,” bɔ okyire sona-horɛ, na yeɛ ole Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Bɔ mekyire ɛhe: Mmeraa ne bɔ ɔwale afoɛ 430 si ne, ɔngora nzesa apam bɔ ne Nyameɛ ayɛ ne, na ɔngora mbɛ bɔhyɛ nanu. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Na sɛ agyapadeɛ ne gyi mmeraa so a, ye de oggyi bɔhyɛ so kõ, nakoso, Nyameɛ nate bɔhyɛ so yeɛ ɔfale agyapadeɛ ne lole Abraham ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Ye de mmeraa ne, né ye adwuma yeɛ ole sɛɛ? Né mmeraa ne kɔmaa bɛkonwu bɛ bɔ bɛto mmeraa ne, kodwu kyɛ Abraham bosoniɛ bɔ bɛhyɛle ye nwo bɔ ne kɔwa. Ná abɔfo nemɔ nate ebie so yeɛ bɛfa bɛsiele berɛ ɔ; ye yeɛ ne ogyi Nyameɛ ne mmenia ne afia ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Sɛ sona-horɛ yɛ apam a, onhia ebie bɔ okogyina afia ɔ, na Nyameɛ koso te komapɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ɛhe kyire kyɛ mmeraa ne tia Nyameɛ bɔhyɛ nemɔ anaa? Dabida! Nakoso mmeraa bɔ bɛfa bɛmane sona ne, sɛ né ɔkora ma sona nya ngoa a, ahaa ye de tenenee nate mmeraa so yeɛ ɔba ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Nakoso, tworɔnzɛm ne fa nningyein mukoraati wura bɔne bo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bɛle gyidie ne konya bɔhyɛ bɔ ogyi Yesu Kristo nu gyidie so ne.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kora bɔ gyidie ba ne, bɛfale yɛ bɛwurale mmeraa bo, maa ɔneane yɛ so mane gyidie bɔ ne bɛkɔla ye ali ne. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Yeti, né mmeraa ne kyire yɛ atee kɔ Kristo so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkobu yɛ bem wɔ gyidie nu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Kesaalae bɔ gyidie awa ne, mmeraa ne ngyire yɛ atee kõ.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Gyidie bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ Yesu Kristo nu nati, ɛmɔ ayɛ Nyameɛ mmaa, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />na ɛmɔ bɔ babɔ ɛmɔ asu bahɔ Kristo nu namukoraati, ɛmɔ awura Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Yeti Yudaniɛ ne Greekniɛ nne berɛ, akoaa ne dehyeɛ nne berɛ, brienzua ne brasua nne berɛ; ofikyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔ ayɛ kõ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Na sɛ ɛmɔte Kristo deɛ a, né ɛmɔte Abraham bosofoɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nate bɔhyɛ naso bɛkoli bia.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Bɔ mekyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔnate kyɛ bɔ okoli bia ne te akwalaa nati, ɔte kyɛ akoaa, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ nikye biala te ye deɛ ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Ole bɛ bɔ bɛnea ye so, ná bɛnea ye agyapadeɛ naso kosi mmerɛ bɔ ye baba ahyɛ ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Sɔ ala yeɛ yɛ koso, mmerɛ bɔ né yɛte ngwalaa ne, ne yayɛ ngoaa yama nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ wiase ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Nakoso mmerɛ ne sone ne, Nyameɛ somane ɔwa ne maa brasua wole ye wɔ mmeraa nabo, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />kyɛ ɔɔye bɛ bɔ bɛwura mmeraa nabo ne, ná wamaa yayɛ Nyameɛ mmaa. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔte Nyameɛ mmaa nati, wasoma ɔwa né honhom ne maa wawa y'ahone nu, na ɔteanu kyɛ “<char style="tl">Abba</char>,” kyire kyɛ “Baba!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Yeti, ɛtte akoaa kõ, ɛte baa, na ɔnate kyɛ ɛte baa nati, ɔnate Nyameɛ so ne, edi bia a ɔyɛ yé.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Mmerɛ bɔ né ɛmɔnze Nyameɛ ne, né ɛmɔ ayɛ ngoaa bama nningyein biemɔ bɔ ɔtte nyameɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Nakoso, kesaalae bɔ ɛmɔ anwu Nyameɛ, anaa kesaalae bɔ Nyameɛ anwu ɛmɔ ne, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔsa bɛkɔ sɔ nningyein bɔ mvasoɛ nne so nanwo, ná ɛmɔ kɔyɛ ngoaa bɛma ye bieku ne? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Nningyein bɔ ɛmɔ asɔ nu twann yeɛ ole ngyẽa, bosome, mmerɛ, ne afoɛ! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Mesuro mema ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ annea a, né ɛmɔ amaa mafɛ magua.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Aliemaa mɔ, mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔyɛ kyɛ me, ofikyɛ me koso, né nde kyɛ ɛmɔ. Ɛmɔ anyɛ me bɔne biala. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ɛmɔse kyɛ anwonyerɛ bɔ ɔbɔle me ne, yeɛ ɔmaa nni moa ngane nzɛmba ne ngyirele ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ɔwɔ nu, m'anwonyerɛ ne yɛle nzɔhwɛ mane ɛmɔ, nakoso ɛmɔ ammu me kyɛ meyɛ tɛ, ná ɛmɔ ambo me. Mmom ɛmɔlɛle me kyɛ Nyameɛ bɔfo, ɛnwa nzɛ me yeɛ né nde Kristo Yesu ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Ye de, ɛmɔ anigye ne afa ni? Ofikyɛ né medɛ́ medi kyɛ, sɛ né ɔkɔyɛ yé a, ahaa ɛmɔ tuli ɛmɔ nye po bɛmane me. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ nati, mayɛ ɛmɔ tamfo anaa? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Sɔ mmenia nemɔ nye aboro kyɛ bekonya ɛmɔ, nakoso bɛlle adwene pa. Bɛpena kyɛ bɛsɛkye mene ɛmɔ afia, ná wamaa ɛmɔ ali bɛ si. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Sɛ ebie le adwene pa, na ɔpena kyɛ ɔne ɛmɔ yɛ kõ a, ɔte pa, nakoso odikyɛ ɔyɛ ye daa, mmom nná mmerɛ bɔ mene ɛmɔ wɔ berɛ ne ngome. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Me mmaa mɔ, mesa medi ɛmɔ nwo yealɛ kyɛ brasua bɔ aworɛ aha ye, kodwu kyɛ ɛmɔ konya Kristo suban ne bie. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa nwɔ ɛmɔ nwo berɛ, na wamaa manwu kyɛbɔ ngɔ dwudwo ɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ ti, menwu bɔ nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔwura mmeraa nabo ne, ɛmɔha behyire me, bɔ mmeraa ne ka ne, ɛmɔnde yebo hɔ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ né Abraham le mmaa nyɔ, ne kõ te abaawa ne awa, yeɛ né kõ te brasua bɔ ole ye nwo ne awa. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Abaawa ne awa ne de, bɛwole ye anwoɔnaen nu, nakoso brasua bɔ ole ye nwo ne awa ne de, bɛnate bɔhyɛ so yeɛ bɛwole ye ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ɛhemɔ gyi berɛ ma nikye bie, mmrasua nyɔ ne gyi berɛ ma apam nyɔ. Apam ne kõ fi Sinai bokaa so, na ye mmaa te ngoaa, ɛhene yeɛ ole Hagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Yeti, Hagar gyi berɛ ma Sinai Bokaa bɔ ɔwɔ Arabia ne, na ye yeɛ ole Yerusalem bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ne, ofikyɛ ɔne ye mmaa te ngoaa. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Nakoso, Yerusalem bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne de, ole ye nwo, na ye yeɛ ole yɛ maame. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Brasua bɔ ɛnwo, wɔ bɔ elle ba ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ma wɔ nye gye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Wɔ bɔ ɛnde aworɛ nu yealɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">di ahurusi ná tea nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ofikyɛ brasua bɔ bapo ye ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ye mmaa sone tra bɔ ogya biaa ne deɛ ne.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔte kyɛ Isaac, bɔ né ɔte bɔhyɛ ba ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ná kyɛbɔ akwalaa bɔ bɛwole ye anwoɔnaen nu ne tanene bɔ bɛnate bɔhyɛ so bɛwole ye ne nye ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔkɔso ɛnɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Nakoso, nzu yeɛ tworɔnzɛm ne ka ɔ? “Foa abaawa ne né ɔwa ne, ofikyɛ abaawa ne awa ne, ɔne brasua bɔ ole ye nwo ne awa ne ngɔbonu nngoli bia.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, yɛtte abaawa ne mmaa, yɛte brasua bɔ ole ye nwo ne mmaa.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Sɔ ahofadie nati yeɛ Kristo amaa yale yɛ nwo ne. Yeti ɛmɔgyina pindinn, na ɛmɔnea kyɛ ɛmɔ ngɔfa ɛmɔ nwo bengowura ngoasom nu kõ.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ɛmɔnea, me Paul, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔma bɛpɛ ɛmɔ toa a, bɔ Kristo ayɛ ne, ɛmɔ nngonya mvasoɛ biala wɔ so. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Mesa meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sona biala bɔ ɔkɔmaa bɛkɔpɛ ye toa ne, mmeraa ne akyekye ye, na odikyɛ odi ye mukoraati so. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ná ɛmɔ nu biala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔfa mmeraa ne bu ye nwo bem ne, ɔne Kristo afia atete, wahwe ye nwo wafi ye adom nanwo. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Na yɛ de, tenenee bɔ yɛ gyidie ti yekonya ye ne, yɛnate honhom naso yɛnea ye atee paa. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ofikyɛ Kristo Yesu nu de, sɛ bapɛ wɔ toa oo, bɛpɛlle wɔ toa oo, ɔnga hwee. Bɔ ohia yeɛ ole gyidie bɔ ofi ɔdɔ nu.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Né ɛmɔtu mirika ne kama. Afei de nwa yeɛ wasi ɛmɔ atee bɔ ɔmma ɛmɔ ndie nahorɛ ne kõ ne? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Bɔ ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ ne, nná sɔ yeɛ ohyirele ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Yiste<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yiste </char><char style="ft" closed="false">te nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛfra esam maa otu.</char></note> kaa bie yeɛ ɔmaa esam namukoraati tu ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Nne ɛmɔ nu gyidie wɔ Awurade nu kyɛ, ɛmɔngonya adwene foforɛ biala. Na bɔ ɔha ɛmɔ ne, sɛ ɔte nzu sona po a, okonya ye nwo atemmuo. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Aliemaa mɔ, afei koso sɛ toa pɛlɛ nwo dwirɛ yeɛ metɛ́ ka a, ye de nzuati yeɛ bɛtane me nye sɔ ne? Sɛ sɔ yeɛ ɔte a, ahaa asɛnnua nanwo sintidua nne berɛ kõ. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa basa mmrienzua bɔ bɛha ɛmɔ adwene namu.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Aliemaa mɔ, bafrɛ ɛmɔ bawa ahofadie nu, nakoso nnɛmɔfa ɛmɔ ahofadie ne bɛyɛ bɔ anwoɔnaen ne kuro ɔ. Mmom ɛmɔfa bɛsõ ɛmɔ nwo wɔ ɔdɔ nu. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ofikyɛ mmeraa namukoraati gyi edwirɛ komapɛ so, yeɛ ole, “Dɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Nakoso, sɛ ɛmɔkɔ so bɛkeka ɛmɔ nwo, na ɛmɔ pire-pira ɛmɔ nwo a, ye de annea a, né ɛmɔ asɛkye ɛmɔ nwo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Bɔ meka yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛnate honhom nu, na ɔngɔma ɛmɔ nngoli anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ si. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Ofikyɛ bɔ anwoɔnaen ne kuro ne, ɔne honhom ne nyia, na bɔ honhom ne kuro ne, ɔne anwoɔnaen ne nyia, ebiala kõ tia ye mmango. Yeti ɛhene nngɔma ɛmɔngɔyɛ bɔ ɛmɔ kuro ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Na sɛ ɛmɔma honhom ne kyire ɛmɔ atee a, ye de, ɛmɔnne mmeraa nabo. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Nningyein bɔ anwoɔnaen ne yɛ ne, wala ali pefee, yeɛ ole: adwamammɔ, bra-bɔne, ahohwibra, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />abosonsom, honhonsɛm, ɔtaen, manzoin, ahoɔyaa, ɛyaa, ɛyakalɛ, mbakye-mbakye-muɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛte bɛ nwo, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />anyeborolɛ, nzãa bolɛ, paati bɔ yebo gye-gyee-gye, ɔne nningyein bɔ ɔtete sɔ ne. Ɛhemɔ nwo yeɛ mebɔ ɛmɔ kɔkɔ, kyɛbɔ nni moa mmɔle ɛmɔ kɔkɔ ne, kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ nningyein ne nngɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Na aba bɔ honhom ne su yeɛ ole ɔdɔ, anigye, asomdwie, aboterɛ, adɔyɛ, pa yɛlɛ, gyidie, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />anwobraseɛ, ɔne ahohyɛsoɛ; mmeraa biala nne berɛ bɔ otia ɛhemɔ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Bɛ bɔ bɛte Kristo Yesu deɛ ne de, babɔ anwoɔnaen ne, ye akɔnnɔ ne, ɔne bɔ okuro namukoraati asɛnnua nu. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Sɛ yɛte honhom nu de a, ɛmɔma yɛli honhom ne gyasi pɛɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Nnɛmaa yɛ nu biala ma ye nwo so, yɛne yɛ nwo si akan, na yɛmaa yɛ nye boro yɛ nwo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, sɛ ebie di mvomsoɛ kora né ye nye awa ye nwo so a, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ nwo akwokwa ne, ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden bɛle ye besie yé, nakoso honhom bɔ odwo yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛyɛ sɔ ɔ. Na ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé, ofikyɛ annea a né basɔ ɛmɔ koso banea. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ná ɛmɔhɔ so bɛboka-boka ɛmɔ nwo,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔboka aliemaa mɔ ma bɛsoa bɛ nningyein bɔ enu yɛ nno ne.”</char></note> sɛ ɛmɔyɛ sɔ a, né ɛmɔdi Kristo mmeraa naso. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Sɛ ebie adwene yɛ ye kyɛ odi mu, nakoso ɔtte huu a, né ɔlaka-laka ye nwo. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Yeti, ɛmɔma ebiala nea kyɛbɔ ye bɔbɔ ye adwuma te ɔ, ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔmaa okonya nikye bie kɔfa kɔhoɔhoa ye nwo, ná ɔtte kyɛ ɔfa ye nwo toto ebie nwo. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ofikyɛ, ebiala kɔsoa ye bɔbɔ ye adesoa.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Afei koso, ebiala bɔ bɛfa edwirɛ ne bɛ kyirekyire ye ne, odikyɛ ɔne bɔ okyirekyire ye ne nya nningyein pa nu kyɛfa.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Nnɛmɔ maa bɛlaka-laka ɛmɔ, Nyameɛ de, bɛngoro ye nwo, ofikyɛ bɔ sona dua ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ ɔkɔpɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Bɔ odua ye anwoɔnaen nu ne, ofi anwoɔnaen nu kɔpɛ bɔ waporɔ; nakoso bɔ odua ye honhom nu ne, ofi honhom nu kɔpɛ daa ngoa. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa yɛpa aba wɔ pa bɔ yɛyɛ nanu, ofikyɛ sɛ yamba aba a, mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛ nu ne, yekonya ye nwo akatua. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Yeti, mmerɛ biala bɔ yekonya ye nwo atee ne, ɛmɔma yɛyɛ mmenia mukoraati pa, ɛnga-nga bɛ bɔ yɛne bɛ bɔ abusua wɔ gyidie nanu ne.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Ɛmɔnea, me bɔbɔ me sa yeɛ mafa mahworɔ edwirɛ he mbiri-mbiri maberɛ ɛmɔ ne.<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Bɛ bɔ bɛpena kyɛ benya mmenia nyunu anuonyam ne, bɛ yeɛ bɛhyɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔpɛ ɛmɔ toa ne, na bɛyɛ sɔ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛngɔ tane bɛ nye wɔ Kristo asɛnnua nanwo. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne po, benni mmeraa naso, nakoso, bɛpena kyɛ ɛmɔpɛ ɛmɔ toa, na bafa ɛmɔ nipadua ne bahoɔhoa bɛ nwo. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Na me de, membena kyɛ mehoɔhoa me nwo, sana y'Awurade Yesu Kristo asɛnnua nanwo. Yenu yeɛ babɔ wiase ne asɛnnua nu bama me, na me koso, babɔ me asɛnnua nu bama ewiase ne. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Yeti, sɛ ebie apɛ ye toa oo, ɔpɛlle oo, ɔnga hwee. Bɔ ohia yeɛ ole kyɛ yɛkɔyɛ abɔdeɛ foforɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Bɛ bɔ bɛkɔfa sɔ akwankyerɛ he bɛkɔbɔ bɛ bra ne, asomdwie ne anwunvoin ha bɛ, ɔha Nyameɛ Israel ne.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, nnɛmaa ebiala ha me kõ, ofikyɛ bahyɛ me nzorɛ kyɛ nde Yesu akoaa.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Aliemaa mɔ, y'Awurade Yesu Kristo adom bóka ɛmɔ so, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔda suban pa ali ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 6:18">Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>